EmailTemplate.textOnly:
You are receiving this email as one of the Pending Leads that you marked for promotion is rejected by the Lead Team. Please see the details below.

Pending Lead Name - {!Opportunity.Account}
Pending Lead Sales Channel - {!Account.SalesChannel__c}
Pending Lead Sales Rep - {!Opportunity.OwnerFullName}
Pending Lead City - {!Account.ShippingCity}
Reason for Rejection - This lead is not promoted because:{!Opportunity.ReasonforRejection__c}

Other Comments:

Please Note:

1) To resend this lead for promotion, please check the 'reason for rejection' and update the Pending Lead on SF and mark it 'Ready' for promotion
2) Promotion request cannot be resend if Pending Lead "Already exists in Accounts" or "Do not meet addition parameters"
3) No Action will be taken if correction request is send by email
